{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3","id":727097,"title":"Demon^3","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-25T14:58:57-07:00","id":727097,"title":"Demon^3","content":"Just for fun, we can currently have an Unchained steal an Astral &quot;Demon&quot; as an Ephemeral Cover. Nothing seems to indicate they <i>can't</i> also being infected with Whisperers (from Inferno) like other supernaturals can. So we can have a Demon, possessed by a Demon, while masquerading as a Demon, yes?<br /> <br /> Any other ways to nest more &quot;Demon&quot; in there?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T15:12:22-07:00","id":727134,"title":"","content":"Ephemeral Cover specifically works on ghosts and spirits. I don't think its phrasing is accidental. Rip the Gates can be used to visit the Astral Realms, though, so an Unchained demon can still masquerade as a goetic demon, but it'd have to be the hard way, without a Cover to paper it over.<br /> <br /> Whisperers I would figure are fair game, as would be pacts with diaboli. The demons of the Inferno corrupt and infect, and the Unchained have no special protections from it.<br /> <br /> It remains to be seen from Awakening Second Edition how much a Mastigos could do to the Unchained by summoning a supernal demon of Pandemonium, but I'd assume it wouldn't be that much less than they could do to anybody else with one.<br /> <br /> A powerful strix, if the vampiric owl-demons count, could attempt to consume and integrate the being of one of the Unchained through Synthesis.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure whether to pity or fear the infernal scion in whose blood runs both the Primum of Unchained progenitors and the devil-ichor of the Seventh Generation. Probably both.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T15:12:59-07:00","id":727136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3#post727097\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just for fun, we can currently have an Unchained steal an Astral &quot;Demon&quot; as an Ephemeral Cover.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2026That's not how that Exploit works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T16:07:28-07:00","id":727249,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727134#post727134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure whether to pity or fear the infernal scion in whose blood runs both the Primum of Unchained progenitors and the devil-ichor of the Seventh Generation. Probably both.</div> </div> </div> </div>Demon-blood member of the Lucifuge (or Les Infants Diabolique)? <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727136#post727136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026That's not how that Exploit works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. It only calls out Ghosts and Spirits, but I always figured that was due to Goetics not being &quot;released&quot; yet.<br /> <br /> Still usable on the Vice focused Spirits, though.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T16:09:02-07:00","id":727254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still usable on the Vice focused Spirits, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still not how that Exploit works. Ephemeral Cover is &quot;carve off chunks of a broad category of ephemera for use in the construction of a Cover that exists in that band of Twilight.&quot; What the spirits or ghosts you carved up <i>were</i> is irrelevant; you're making a Cover that reads as &quot;a ghost&quot; or &quot;a spirit&quot; out of whole cloth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T16:11:17-07:00","id":727272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727254#post727254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Still not how that Exploit works. Ephemeral Cover is &quot;carve off chunks of a broad category of ephemera for use in the construction of a Cover that exists in that band of Twilight.&quot; What the spirits or ghosts you carved up <i>were</i> is irrelevant; you're making a Cover that reads as &quot;a ghost&quot; or &quot;a spirit&quot; out of whole cloth.</div> </div> </div> </div>Works fine if you don't need to be a specific preexisting spirit of vice, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T16:26:39-07:00","id":727331,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727272#post727272\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Works fine if you don't need to be a specific preexisting spirit of vice, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>My initial contention was on &quot;<u>steal</u> an Astral 'Demon' as an Ephemeral Cover&quot; moreso than &quot;steal an <u>Astral</u> 'Demon' as an Ephemeral Cover,&quot; which you've covered amply. Enough people seem to lack an understanding of how Ephemeral Cover works that I felt it bore emphasis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T16:52:07-07:00","id":727381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727254#post727254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Still not how that Exploit works. Ephemeral Cover is &quot;carve off chunks of a broad category of ephemera for use in the construction of a Cover that exists in that band of Twilight.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is exactly how I meant it...<br /> <br /> The idea being to masquerade as another &quot;demon&quot;. The specific being is irrelevant, only so long as it fulfills the &quot;demon&quot; criteria.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T17:11:27-07:00","id":727403,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727381#post727381\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which is exactly how I meant it...<br /> <br /> The idea being to masquerade as another &quot;demon&quot;. The specific being is irrelevant, only so long as it fulfills the &quot;demon&quot; criteria.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then your use of wording suggesting that you take a particular identity <i>from</i> something else was poorly chosen. &quot;Build an Astral Cover&quot; is not what comes to mind when you say &quot;steal [an entity].&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Convince a Mastigos or other Mind mage to evoke the demon's goetic demons&quot; is the only further suggestion I can offer without clarification on what the actual goal is here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-25T19:57:16-07:00","id":727925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727403#post727403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then your use of wording suggesting that you take a particular identity <i>from</i> something else was poorly chosen. &quot;Build an Astral Cover&quot; is not what comes to mind when you say &quot;steal [an entity].&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, considering a Demon needs a good amount of Corpus harvested to make a decent Cover, said entity may not exist any more. And since they still have a Cover they need to abide by, the easiest thing to do would be to pretend to be the being that they just &quot;ate&quot;. If a Demon harvests the Ghost of Timberlake Sawmill, the easiest way to maintain a ghost Cover is to take up that very mantle. Similar intent behind the word &quot;steal&quot;.<br /> <br /> That's irrelevant, though. I trust the details/intent are clear now?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/727097-demon-3?p=727403#post727403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Convince a Mastigos or other Mind mage to evoke the demon's goetic demons&quot; is the only further suggestion I can offer without clarification on what the actual goal is here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Goal: exploiting how prevalent the word &quot;demon&quot; is used to describe diverse groupings of entities, and chain them together in a description that sounds as ridiculous as possible when deprived of their unique descriptors.<br /> <br /> So, we are at: A Demon (Goetic Manifestation) pulled/incarnated from a Demon (Unchained), possessed by a Demon (Infernal), while pretending to be a Demon (Vice Spirit)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}